  /** What the screen pre-selects: the existing grant's budget on re-consent; on first consent, the app's optional per-user suggestion without a platform clamp. A request's `f2z_spend_cap` hint replaces it only when it fits the registration's default and the existing grant by a lower amount at their period, so it is never higher. Null means prepaid balance without an extra app budget. */
